00:06:51,428 --> 00:06:57,428
A place you leave is a place that lives forever.

2
00:13:42,857 --> 00:13:48,857
The Lost City is a drama, romance, history film directed by Andy Garcia.

3
00:20:34,285 --> 00:20:40,285
In Havana, Cuba in the late 1950's, a wealthy family, one of whose sons is a prominent nightclub owner, is caught in
the violent transition from the oppressive regime of Batista to the Marxist government of Fidel Castro.

4
00:27:25,714 --> 00:27:31,714
Castro's regime ultimately leads the nightclub owner to flee to New York.

5
00:34:17,142 --> 00:34:23,142
Fico Fellove, played by Andy Garcia.

6
00:41:08,571 --> 00:41:14,571
Don Donoso Fellove, played by Richard Bradford.

7
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Luis Fellove, played by Nestor Carbonell.

8
00:54:51,428 --> 00:54:57,428
Ricardo Fellove, played by Enrique Murciano.

9
