10
01:08:34,285 --> 01:08:40,285
Meyer Lansky, played by Dustin Hoffman.

11
01:15:25,714 --> 01:15:31,714
The Lost City is a 2005 American drama film
directed and co-produced by Andy García.

12
01:22:17,142 --> 01:22:23,142
It stars García, Dustin Hoffman, Inés Sastre and Bill Murray.

13
01:29:08,571 --> 01:29:14,571
The film depicts the story of Fico Fellove, a wealthy nightclub owner in Havana
and his family whose lives are disrupted by the Cuban Revolution.

14
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
Attempting to remain apolitical, Fellove's family becomes divided when his brothers
join the Marxist rebels in their fight against the Batista regime.

15
01:42:51,428 --> 01:42:57,428
The film was a passion project for García, who immigrated from Cuba to Miami at the start
of Fidel Castro's rule, and had been trying to make the film for 16 years.

16
01:49:42,857 --> 01:49:48,857
It was filmed in the Dominican Republic instead of Cuba, as García was
denied entry to the country due to his criticism of Castro.

17
01:56:34,285 --> 01:56:40,285
The film received generally negative reviews from critics, who criticized the
screenplay, direction and the depiction of historical events.

18
02:03:25,714 --> 02:03:31,714
It bombed at the box office, making $4.4 million on a $9.6 million budget.

19
02:10:17,142 --> 02:10:23,142
The film explores themes of cuba, che guevara, fidel castro.

20
02:17:08,571 --> 02:17:14,571
The tone is dark and emotional.
